    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.99369812011719,
        503.0520935058594,
        123.59259796142578
      ],
      "text": "students think it's unfair that they're being judged on their handwriting, not\njust their knowledge.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        136.5320587158203,
        128.062255859375,
        156.033447265625
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.63470458984375,
        508.3373107910156,
        215.03359985351562
      ],
      "text": "Marks are definitely affected if examiners can read the script. That is why it\nhas always been so important to teach children to write legibly. Do you think\nthe role of handwriting will change in the future?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        227.97206115722656,
        105.86299896240234,
        247.47344970703125
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        248.07469177246094,
        513.2567749023438,
        326.3926086425781
      ],
      "text": "I can't see that changing much. Touch typing still isn't taught in most schools,\nwhich is a shame. But maybe that won't be necessary in the future, because\npeople will also be able to write by hand on digital devices. Anyway, teachers\nunderstand the value of handwriting. It's a basic life skill.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        339.33203125,
        128.062255859375,
        358.83343505859375
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        359.4346923828125,
        501.77435302734375,
        398.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "True. However, the fact is that people are writing by hand less and less and\nrelying on digital devices. That does cause some problems.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        410.85205078125,
        105.86299896240234,
        430.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        430.9546813964844,
        403.7390441894531,
        449.75360107421875
      ],
      "text": "You mean like note-taking. There are lots of apps for that.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        462.6920471191406,
        128.062255859375,
        482.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        482.6746826171875,
        522.9773559570312,
        541.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "And for reading historical documents, apparently. But my mum is shocked by\nmy awful spelling and the fact that my punctuation is really inconsistent. I think\nyou can put that down to lack of practice.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        554.1320190429688,
        105.86299896240234,
        573.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        574.2347412109375,
        526.8596801757812,
        652.5526123046875
      ],
      "text": "I expect so. Personally, I miss writing by hand. I hardly ever write anything now.\nI remember my grandparents had such beautiful handwriting and it was so\nindividual. Nobody I know would be able to identify my handwriting now. It's a\nshame.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        665.4920654296875,
        128.062255859375,
        684.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        685.4747314453125,
        512.29150390625,
        724.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "I know. I feel the same way. I used to write a diary by hand and now I do that\ndigitally. It just seems less effort to do it that way. So it's not just a problem...\n"
    }
